ural Education from Michigan State University and has trained over 3,000 Master Gardener volunteers across the Midwest. Author of four gardening books including The Four-Season Harvest Handbook (Storey Publishing) and Companion Planting Decoded, an Amazon bestseller in the Organic Gardening category. Former extension agent for the USDA Cooperative Extension Service and regular contributor to Fine Gardening, Organic Gardening Magazine, and the National Gardening Association educational programs.\"}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/05-hs12ys24cd.js\",\"async\":true}]\na:[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$c\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@d\"}]}]\nd:null\n","/authors":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:[]\n0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}]}]]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":\"$W4\",\"buildId\":\"5kFMDGTMrJ-s-szRkHOiU\"}\n","/_index":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[79520,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"\"]\n3:I[98840,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[70119,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[8821,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0jhgiju6t94~i.js\"],\"default\"]\n7:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0f3k24d_5_t~w.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\"],\"default\"]\n8:I[22016,[\"/_next/st